    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERVIEW </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your crew take shared control of a vehicle, driving helpless passengers across a dangerous wasteland filled with zombies, bandits, and monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you deliver them safely, you get paid! Use that money to upgrade your guns and vehicle and be a better taxi service.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to increase the number of passengers you drop off before your vehicle breaks down and you have to start over from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All in the world of Tombstone Taxi!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-PLAYER COUCH CO-OP</strong><br>Gather your crew and head out to fight zombies, bandits, and more while you take people from Crescent Ridge or the Outposts to Spirowood! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player gets to choose which crew member they want to while out in the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/64663f60d13e586231e997d3e6ed6934.poster.avif?t=1747429314\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/64663f60d13e586231e997d3e6ed6934.webm?t=1747429314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/64663f60d13e586231e997d3e6ed6934.mp4?t=1747429314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHARE ONE VEHICLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone drives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone shoots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And someone yells from the back while NOBODY IS DOING THEIR JOB RIGHT?! CMON! HURRY UP BOB!!! SHOOT 'EM!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take shared control of a single vehicle and navigate as a team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DELIVER PASSENGERS FOR MONEY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use money earned from taxiing passengers to upgrade weapons and vehicles for more explosive action! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So go visit Jerry's shop and he might be able to craft you something brand spanking new. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/14fe1ece49bb5f90419b6d16061821e7.poster.avif?t=1747429314\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/14fe1ece49bb5f90419b6d16061821e7.webm?t=1747429314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/14fe1ece49bb5f90419b6d16061821e7.mp4?t=1747429314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAIN TEMPORARY POWERUPS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your Taxi's power with upgrades out in the field and from Wanda's shop in the Outposts. Sadly, the Chief hasn't found a way to retain that power between trips so you'll need to re-acquire those powerups every time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/ec3885dcb86dabcda69bca11a47fc157.poster.avif?t=1747429314\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/ec3885dcb86dabcda69bca11a47fc157.webm?t=1747429314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/ec3885dcb86dabcda69bca11a47fc157.mp4?t=1747429314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE WASTELAND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a constant turf war between the bandits and monsters, so the land is always in flux, you never know what the day will bring. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies. Skeletons. Bandit gangs!! Scorpion men? Walking bombs?! Radation-spewing-leech-crawler-3-legged mutation?!? Yuck. It's gonna be a tough ride. Buckle up back there! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/744a61ebc36429b53031eebf0340d1eb.poster.avif?t=1747429314\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/744a61ebc36429b53031eebf0340d1eb.webm?t=1747429314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/744a61ebc36429b53031eebf0340d1eb.mp4?t=1747429314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEAT THE BOSS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when you thought it was over... The wasteland doubles down on its threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you work together well? Or will your vehicle break down and have you starting over from scratch?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/7a983eb776f0c90ffc453eeadc7b5223.poster.avif?t=1747429314\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/7a983eb776f0c90ffc453eeadc7b5223.webm?t=1747429314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/7a983eb776f0c90ffc453eeadc7b5223.mp4?t=1747429314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERVIEW </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your crew take shared control of a vehicle, driving helpless passengers across a dangerous wasteland filled with zombies, bandits, and monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you deliver them safely, you get paid! Use that money to upgrade your guns and vehicle and be a better taxi service.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to increase the number of passengers you drop off before your vehicle breaks down and you have to start over from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All in the world of Tombstone Taxi!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-PLAYER COUCH CO-OP</strong><br>Gather your crew and head out to fight zombies, bandits, and more while you take people from Crescent Ridge or the Outposts to Spirowood! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player gets to choose which crew member they want to while out in the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/64663f60d13e586231e997d3e6ed6934.poster.avif?t=1747429314\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/64663f60d13e586231e997d3e6ed6934.webm?t=1747429314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/64663f60d13e586231e997d3e6ed6934.mp4?t=1747429314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHARE ONE VEHICLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone drives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone shoots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And someone yells from the back while NOBODY