9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/ec3885dcb86dabcda69bca11a47fc157.mp4?t=1747429314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE WASTELAND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a constant turf war between the bandits and monsters, so the land is always in flux, you never know what the day will bring. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies. Skeletons. Bandit gangs!! Scorpion men? Walking bombs?! Radation-spewing-leech-crawler-3-legged mutation?!? Yuck. It's gonna be a tough ride. Buckle up back there! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/744a61ebc36429b53031eebf0340d1eb.poster.avif?t=1747429314\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/744a61ebc36429b53031eebf0340d1eb.webm?t=1747429314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/744a61ebc36429b53031eebf0340d1eb.mp4?t=1747429314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEAT THE BOSS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when you thought it was over... The wasteland doubles down on its threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you work together well? Or will your vehicle break down and have you starting over from scratch?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2472700/extras/7a983eb776f0c90ffc453eeadc7b5223.poster.avif?t=1747429314\" ><source src=\"https:/